keywords:
  - Fano index
  - weighted projective space
  - Calabi-Yau variety
  - log canonical singularity
  - index
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  We prove that Liu's conjecture on Fano indices fails in dimension four:
  1389 is the index of a terminal Calabi-Yau fourfold and of a
  four-dimensional log canonical singularity, but it is not the Fano index of
  any canonical weighted projective space of dimension four. The
  non-membership is checked in the Lean 4 kernel.
